{"id":"630051","name":"最薄菜团子","author":"单单恰饭人","authorId":"11030547","desc":"","cover":"images/630051/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"菠菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"浓汤宝","amount":"一个"},{"name":"耗油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"五香粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"玉米面","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"材料洗净备用。","img":"images/630051/step_1.jpeg"},{"step":2,"desc":"都切成小块后放入干净的盆里，放入耗油，五香粉，盐，油。","img":"images/630051/step_2.jpeg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入面粉增加粘性。","img":"images/630051/step_3.jpeg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋煎好，小块，放入浓汤宝。","img":"images/630051/step_4.jpeg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/630051/step_5.jpeg"},{"step":6,"desc":"准备两种玉米面，这可以是一种。","img":"images/630051/step_6.jpeg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把馅料团成球状。","img":"images/630051/step_7.jpeg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入细的里面裹上一层，在上粗的里面裹上一层就好了！","img":"images/630051/step_8.jpeg"},{"step":9,"desc":"上锅蒸15分钟即可。","img":"images/630051/step_9.jpeg"},{"step":10,"desc":"蒸的时候缝隙大些。","img":"images/630051/step_10.jpeg"},{"step":11,"desc":"蒸好了。","img":"images/630051/step_11.jpeg"},{"step":12,"desc":"盛出！","img":"images/630051/step_12.jpeg"},{"step":13,"desc":"恰饭！","img":"images/630051/step_13.jpeg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}